#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we describe how variational quantum algorithms can be applied to chemistry problems, max-cut, and more!"
msgstr "Di sini kita membahas bagaimana algoritma quantum variasional bisa diterapkan untuk masalah kimia, Max-Cut, dan lainnya!"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples and applications"
msgstr "Contoh dan aplikasi"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
