#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "During this lesson, we'll explore some variational algorithm examples and how to apply them:\n"
msgstr "Di pelajaran ini, kita akan menjelajahi beberapa contoh algoritma variasional dan cara menerapkannya:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to write a custom variational algorithm\n"
msgstr "Cara menulis algoritma variasional kustom\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to apply a variational algorithm to find minimum eigenvalues\n"
msgstr "Cara menerapkan algoritma variasional untuk mencari nilai eigen minimum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to utilize variational algorithms to solve application use cases\n"
msgstr "Cara memanfaatkan algoritma variasional untuk menyelesaikan kasus penggunaan aplikasi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that the Qiskit patterns framework can be applied to all the problems we introduce here. However, to avoid repetition, we will only explicitly call out the framework steps in one example case, run on real hardware.\n"
msgstr "Perhatikan bahwa framework pola Qiskit bisa diterapkan ke semua masalah yang kita perkenalkan di sini. Namun, untuk menghindari pengulangan, kita hanya akan menyebut langkah-langkah framework secara eksplisit dalam satu contoh kasus, yang dijalankan di hardware nyata.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problem definitions {#problem-definitions}"
msgstr "Definisi masalah {#problem-definitions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Imagine that we want to use a variational algorithm to find the eigenvalue of the following observable:\n"
msgstr "Bayangkan kita ingin menggunakan algoritma variasional untuk mencari nilai eigen dari observable berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\hat{O}_1 = 2 II - 2 XX + 3 YY - 3 ZZ,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\hat{O}_1 = 2 II - 2 XX + 3 YY - 3 ZZ,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This observable has the following eigenvalues:\n"
msgstr "Observable ini memiliki nilai eigen berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\left\\{\n"
"\\begin{array}{c}\n"
"\\lambda_0 = -6 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_1 = 4 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_2 = 4 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_3 = 6\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\left\\{\n"
"\\begin{array}{c}\n"
"\\lambda_0 = -6 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_1 = 4 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_2 = 4 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_3 = 6\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "And eigenstates:\n"
msgstr "Dan eigenstate-nya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\left\\{\n"
"\\begin{array}{c}\n"
"|\\phi_0\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle + |11\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_1\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle - |11\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_2\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|01\\rangle - |10\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_3\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|01\\rangle + |10\\rangle)\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\left\\{\n"
"\\begin{array}{c}\n"
"|\\phi_0\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle + |11\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_1\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle - |11\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_2\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|01\\rangle - |10\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_3\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|01\\rangle + |10\\rangle)\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom VQE {#custom-vqe}"
msgstr "VQE kustom {#custom-vqe}"

